00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.900
on platforms such as Questrade or Interactive Brogers.

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:17.580
Position size stays at 5% to 10% of the speculative sleeve.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:25.200
