00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:31.800
accompanied earnings beats. They also produced outsized losses during the 2022 rate hike period.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:38.820
The key risk is daily reset mechanics that cause compounding drag in sideways or volatile markets.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:44.580
Always compare the ETF's 20-day average volume against its assets under management

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:50.900
before entry to avoid liquidity traps. This approach demonstrates how to stay disciplined when

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:55.920
